  technicalMessages:
  - Daniel woke up in his apartment with unbearable vertigo. His sleep had been restless.
    It felt like he had been dreaming about something.
  - 'Someone had messed up his home: some things were not in their usual places.
    Perhaps if he put everything back where it belonged, the vertigo would stop.'
