  m_text: A young man named Tommy Ray died today. According to witnesses, he fell
    out of the window of his apartment. Neighbors say that Tommy had been acting
    strangely in the days leading up to his death. Some claim that he had become
    increasingly paranoid and believed that someone was following him. The police
    have not yet determined whether his death was an accident or suicide. The investigation
    is still ongoing.
